      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Governance &amp; accountability</span>
        <h2 class="display-caps">Open books, on purpose.</h2>
        <p>We publish our accounts because women deciding whether to trust us, and donors deciding whether to fund us, both deserve to see the same numbers.</p>      </div>
      <ul class="checklist">
                <li>Registered with <strong>[CAC / relevant regulator]</strong>, registration number <strong>[XXXX]</strong>.</li>
                <li>Governed by a Board of Trustees of <strong>[X]</strong> members.</li>
                <li>Annual reports and audited financials published here: [link].</li>
                <li>Safeguarding policy: [link].</li>
                <li>Confidentiality policy: [link].</li>
                <li>Complaints procedure: [link].</li>
              </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="callout" style="margin-top:2.5rem">
      <h4>Our line on donor access</h4>
      <p class="mb-0">We do not accept donations conditional on access to survivors’ identities or stories. No donor, partner or journalist is introduced to a woman we support without her prior, written, revocable consent.</p>
